OL,3,GNEWSA'Such terrible waste' as health
OL,4,Atrust buildings could cost an extra
OL,5,A#20m
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlmost #20m in additional costs due to
OL,8,Fproblems at two Belfast Health Trust
OL,9,Fbuildings has been described as "such
OL,10,Fterrible waste".
OL,12,FNewly-discovered issues with the
OL,13,FBelfast maternity hospital could add
OL,14,Falmost #10m to the project's spiralling
OL,15,Fcosts, while the amount spent on
OL,16,Frepairs and rehousing patients at the
OL,17,FAcute Mental Health facility has now
OL,18,Freached #9.4m.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
