OL,3,GNEWSA'Such terrible waste' as health
OL,4,Atrust buildings could cost an extra
OL,5,A#20m
OL,6,
OL,7,FDaniel McCrossan, who chairs the Public
OL,8,FAccounts Committee, said: "We can't see
OL,9,Fsuch waste, such terrible waste, within
OL,10,Four public sector and then still go to
OL,11,FLondon and demand more [money]."
OL,13,FThe Department of Health (DoH) said the
OL,14,Fextra building costs are
OL,15,F"disappointing" but it is essential
OL,16,Fthey are "completed and delivered".
